  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "Despite having defensive capabilities via its Zappies, the O.T.T.O's Outpost does not count as a defensive building for stage quotas (it is instead locked to being placed in stage two). It will not meet the defense-upgrading requirement of B.O.B Control if it is upgraded to level 9."
  ],
